<title>MAURITIUS: SOCCER-MAURITIUS AND ZAMBIA DRAW 0-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MAURITIUS AND ZAMBIA DRAW 0-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>CUREPIPE, Mauritius 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mauritius and Zambia drew 0-0 in an African Nations Cup group seven qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000.</p>
</text>
